er uniformly and randomly from $1$ to $n$. What is the expected value of the player’s guess?"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186208946 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186208563 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "753c2aae-9fc7-5b5b-930e-87222f30f7a2" :knowledge-point/title "Applying the Tower Property in Context"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/id #uuid "43b17d3b-03b0-5905-9862-543ee5a6fde9" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186205427}] :question/id #uuid "d8f9a785-f3a0-5c7d-87e9-2dbe1e634d2d" :question/math-academy-id "q-275335" :question/problem "A video game randomly selects a level difficulty $d$ from $1$ to $500$, with each value equally likely. Once the difficulty is chosen, a treasure chest is placed in one of $d$ zones within the level, numbered from $1$ to $d$, with each zone equally likely to receive the chest.\n\nWhat is the expected number of the zone where the chest appears?\n\nThe expected number of the zone where the chest appears is\n{{field-1}}."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186208947 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186208562 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ca941236-4ae9-5740-bfbf-d15eb758212a" :knowledge-point/title "Applying the Tower Property"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8bce4a05-5700-536d-aac0-b073f48479b3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186205429} {:answer/id #uuid "ba3a2ab4-c2d1-5222-b4db-20fd84eca4bc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2.5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186205430} {:answer/id #uuid "c5f6d382-c842-5005-ad09-bb5c9c65712a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3.5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186205431} {:answer/id #uuid "e34f8821-9f79-5474-8ecd-5d92a48de232" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 1759218